=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;0e5067f5b53d2def89a12d5bd00810ecd1eb0f4ec1d6acd5346bcdb413700e9c&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;美立法禁止中国产汽车取得突破，国会力争年底前通过&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/xhqcankao/33383&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;风向旗参考快讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27T06:09:14+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;美国国会正推动通过《联网汽车安全法案》，旨在禁止进口含中国及俄罗斯零部件的汽车。在参议员伯尼·莫雷诺和埃莉莎·斯洛特金的推动下，法案已通过调整定义获得欧美车企支持，特别是解决了梅赛德斯-奔驰等含有非直接中国股份企业的疑虑。新版草案移除了对电池本身的限制，仅针对电池管理系统，且增加了日落条款。法案目前旨在争取年底前通过，这将进一步强化美方对华立场，尽管此前特朗普总统曾对中国企业在美建厂持开放态度。\\n\\n—— POLITICO&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-27T06:09:14+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-27T06:09:14+08:00","source":"xhqcankao","topic":"汽车","uid":"0e5067f5b53d2def89a12d5bd00810ecd1eb0f4ec1d6acd5346bcdb413700e9c"},{"alias":"FinanceNewsDaily","day":"2026-11-27","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"财经\" data-ch=\"FinanceNewsDaily\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"FinanceNewsDaily\">华尔街见闻·财经时讯</span><span class=\"cat\">财经</span></span><time datetime=\"202